 those  lines were sung  right as we were being shown momonosuke  yamato as maria continues to rock  out in what is sure to be a glorious  scene in the anime we jump to the battle  between the red scabbars and kaido  absolutely gorgeous art here odin told  kaido  not to underestimate his samurai and i  think we all did to an extent  but these guys have more than delivered  on what was expected of them and they  continue to do so  as i've been mentioning frequently kaido  is not  undefeatable as soon as he was  introduced we were told that he tasted  defeat as a pirate multiple times  it's just that no one could kill him not  even himself  we were also told always been on kaido  in a one-on-one fight but this clearly  isn't a one-on-one fight  we got nine underestimated samurai here  counting ezo  and they're doing absolutely amazing and  keep in mind  help is coming in the form of luffy and  friends too kaido is mythical in every  sense when he  roars lightning comes out although the  scabbards succeed in avoiding any damage  we get sulong nekomamushi hit kaido with  his paw  kawamatsu slices kaido's mouth and beast  pirates continue to be shocked that  these nine are actually hurting kaido  just as kaido sends kawamatsu flying  inwarashi stabs him with his sword leg  penetrating his skin keep in mind when  people tried the guillotine kaido the  blade just cracked so the fact that  these guys are penetrating his skin is  no small feat  izo and kiku attack and hit but kaido  says enough nonsense  none of the attacks bear any resemblance  to odin and let's keep in mind that odin  in my view was best in kaido in their  past fight before odin was distracted  into thinking that his son was in danger  odin arguably had kaido on the ropes  before the distraction  and kaido did not end up giving him a  fair fight after he used a distraction  to take him out  these nine here are odin students and  they have trained and improved since  then  so it's not crazy to think that together  if they internalize their teachers  lessons  they could hurt kaido especially if we  throw in kaido's mental instability  right now  just like how the memory of yorichi  freaks out muzon and awakens old wounds  and demon slayer  i feel like odin's memory is  destabilizing kaido  leading to weaker defenses as well  although we must also assume that kairo  is much stronger than he was back then  during the odin fight  this is when we get my favorite moment  in this chapter ryzo who i must admit  that i underestimated  comes in clutch showing he's the mvp of  this chapter  rhizo uses a ninja scroll to seal  kaido's blast breath attack  and then proceeds to unleash it back  against him what an amazing moment  even kaido must be hurt by his own  powerful attack i absolutely love it  that rhizo got his chance to shine here  and again we have beast pirates shocked  that kaido is taking so much damage  and clearly kaido is having trouble or  he would have just finished them all off  by now  we have a flashback of odin wanting to  teach his two-sword style to his  students  but at the time they didn't want to  learn however by now it seems like  inuarashi kinemon denjiro and  ashra actually have learned it which is  hype because that style was clearly the  most  effective we've ever seen against kaido  kaido calls it a cheap imitation  and we get more flashbacks of odin  talking about ryo  akidowano term for busochoku haki  this type of hockey when advanced enough  can be emitted  from the user or their weapons and  destroy the target from inside out  luffy thought that this might help him  hurt the seemingly invincible kaido  and clearly it does work on kaido the  four mentioned red scabbards use the  exact move  paradise totsuka that odin used to harm  kaido  so bad so many years ago not only that  they use it on the scar odin left  reopening it amazing stuff simply  amazing they are building on odin's  legacy together so whatever they  accomplish  it's thanks to o